## Why This Is Asked
Assess ability to design governance-aware, low-latency LLM gating in multi-tenant contexts with compliance, verifiable provenance, and drift detection.

## Key Concepts
- Policy schema design for strict data governance
- Real-time evaluation and routing with canary semantics
- Tamper-evident logging and prompt hashing
